%% id: multi-agent-termination-state-machine
%% title: Multi-Agent 终止与死锁状态机
%% alt: 协作任务在 Ready Running Waiting Reviewed Done Failed 之间转换并由依赖超时预算和验收控制终止
stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Ready
    Ready --> Running
    Running --> Waiting
    Waiting --> Ready: 依赖就绪
    Running --> Reviewed
    Reviewed --> Ready: 需要返工
    Reviewed --> Done: 验收通过
    Waiting --> Failed: 死锁或超时
    Running --> Failed: 预算或错误
